# All NEXT_PUBLIC_* values are, by definition, shipped to the browser.
# Never put a private key or any other secret in this file or in any
# NEXT_PUBLIC_* variable — the browser wallet (Freighter) is always the
# signing authority; this app never holds a key of its own.

